Case 1: Korean string literal with LENGTH/OCTET_LENGTH/CHARSET     

===================================================
'한글'    char_length('한글')    octet_length('한글')    charset('한글')    
한글     2     6     utf8     

===================================================
    
Case 2: Han character and emoji (multi-byte UTF-8) literal     

===================================================
'漢字'    '😀'    char_length('😀')    octet_length('😀')    
漢字     😀     1     4     

===================================================
    
Case 3: full-width space literal, LENGTH vs OCTET_LENGTH     

===================================================
'전각　공백'    char_length('　')    octet_length('　')    
전각　공백     1     3     

===================================================
0
===================================================
1
